cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this standards mapping, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "GreenCalculus Standards Mapping"
abstract: >
  An open mapping between the global greenhouse-gas accounting standards and the
  calculations that implement them — GHG Protocol Corporate and Scope 3, the Land
  Sector and Removals Guidance (2026), IPCC AR6 GWP-100, ISO 14064-1, CSRD/ESRS
  E1, SBTi near-term and net-zero, PCAF financed emissions, and the DEFRA/DESNZ
  conversion factors. Each entry names the clause or table it implements, so a
  reported figure can be traced to the standard that governs it.
authors:
  - family-names: Say
    given-names: Jeremiah
    affiliation: "GreenCalculus"
date-released: "2026-06-20"
url: "https://greencalculus.com/standards/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/greencalculus/greencalculus-standards"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - GHG Protocol
  - Scope 3
  - CSRD
  - ESRS E1
  - SBTi
  - ISO 14064
  - IPCC AR6
  - PCAF
  - carbon accounting
  - standards mapping
